	myDescription "branch = \"DLC2\", contextComment = \"In World Message Description\", enabled = true, guid = #91D5D542679CDBE1000000470120A4D9, lineVersion = 4, maxLength = 0, productId = -1, sectionId = 12368, text = \"The crew votes on everything, and any raider can call for a vote. When a decision's made, everyone falls in line.\n\nThe crew chooses the captain. If the crew votes to replace the captain, the captain has to go.\n\nPay comes out of the haul from the raids. No prey, no pay.\n\nThe captain gets an equal share. Old timers get two shares. If a raider takes a bad hit or loses a limb, they get a share and a half.\n\nDroids can't vote, and droids don't get shares.\n\nThe crew is loyal to each other. Not to other bands, not to the syndicates, and not to the government.\n\nAny raider who shirks their watch or lets their blaster go rusty loses their share.\n\nAny raider caught stealing or selling out the crew gets marooned on an asteroid with a day of air.\", type = \"MenuLine\"}"
